---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import CardArt from '../components/CardArt.astro';
import { url } from '../utils/url';
const comparisons = [
  {
    name: 'Apex vs HYDROS vs GHL ProfiLux',
    desc: 'The full reef controller comparison — kits and recorded prices, probes included vs extra, cloud fees, programming models, dosing and automated-testing ecosystems, and which controller fits which builder.',
    href: '/compare/apex-vs-hydros-vs-ghl',
    status: 'New',
    art: 'controller',
  },
  {
    name: 'Reef Octopus vs Nyos vs AquaMaxx Skimmers',
    desc: 'The skimmer brand face-off, computed — dollars per honestly-rated gallon and watts per 100 gallons, from published medium-bioload ratings, not box numbers.',
    href: '/compare/reef-octopus-vs-nyos-vs-aquamaxx',
    status: 'New',
    art: 'skimmer',
  },
  {
    name: 'Hanna vs Salifert vs Red Sea Test Kits',
    desc: 'Published accuracy and resolution specs, starter-kit allocation and refill cost per test, and the digital-vs-color-endpoint divide — for all five parameters reefers test.',
    href: '/reviews/best-reef-test-kits',
    status: 'New',
    art: 'testkit',
  },
  {
    name: 'DC vs AC Return Pumps',
    desc: 'Controllability, noise, efficiency, price, and the failure mode most people miss — the buying decision behind every pump pick.',
    href: '/guides/dc-vs-ac-return-pumps',
    status: 'Guide',
    art: 'pump',
  },
  {
    name: 'Reef Salt Mixes, Cost per Gallon',
    desc: 'Recorded package prices and yields, with different or unknown salinity bases shown before comparing value.',
    href: '/reviews/best-reef-salt-mix',
    status: 'Data',
    art: 'salt',
  },
];
---
<Base
  title="Compare Reef Gear — Head-to-Head"
  description="Side-by-side reef equipment comparisons: Apex vs HYDROS vs GHL controllers, DC vs AC return pumps, and salt packages with their stated yield limits."
>
  <section class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow" style="color:var(--brand-2)">Compare</p>
    <h1>Compare reef gear, spec by spec.</h1>
    <p style="color:var(--muted);max-width:62ch;">The decisions reefers actually agonize over, settled with specs and prices in one table — sourced, dated, and independent of who pays commission. <a href={url('/how-we-rate')}>How we rate →</a></p>
    <div class="grid cols-2" style="margin-top:26px;">
      {comparisons.map((c) => (
        <a class="card cardlink" href={url(c.href)}>
          <CardArt kind={c.art} />
          <span class="pill">{c.status}</span>
          <h3>{c.name}</h3>
          <p style="color:var(--muted)">{c.desc}</p>
        </a>
      ))}
    </div>
    <p style="color:var(--muted);margin-top:28px;font-size:.9rem;">Looking for lighting? See <a href={url('/reviews/best-reef-led-lighting')}>Reef LED Lighting: readings and test limits</a>.</p>
    <h2>Choose the comparison that fits the decision</h2>
    <p>Start with <a href={url('/guides/dc-vs-ac-return-pumps')}>AC pump vs DC pump</a> for control and electricity use, then compare <a href={url('/reviews/best-return-pumps')}>return pumps for your reef tank</a> at the same plumbing. For maintenance hardware, compare <a href={url('/reviews/best-reef-dosing-pumps')}>reef dosing pumps</a> by controller needs and <a href={url('/reviews/best-ato')}>ATO systems</a> by their backup shutoffs.</p>
    <p>For a new tank, start with equipment size before choosing a brand. Use the <a href={url('/tools/return-pump-calculator')}>return pump calculator</a> to check the flow your plumbing needs, or the <a href={url('/tools/protein-skimmer-calculator')}>skimmer size calculator</a> to account for stocking. A cheaper unit is poor value if it cannot fit the sump or supply the water your setup needs.</p>
    <p>If you already know the size, compare what is included in the price. The <a href={url('/compare/apex-vs-hydros-vs-ghl')}>Apex, HYDROS, and GHL comparison</a> separates controller kits, probes, and expansion hardware. The <a href={url('/reviews/best-reef-test-kits')}>test kit comparison</a> looks at cost per test as well as the first box price. The <a href={url('/reviews/best-reef-salt-mix')}>salt package comparison</a> shows stated yields and salinity limits. Different label gallons are not automatically equal reef gallons.</p>
    <p>Check each page's source dates and assumptions. These are comparisons of published data, not personal product tests. Confirm today's price, model revision, and available parts with the retailer before buying.</p>
  </section>
</Base>
